{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39712","headline":"客舍秋晚夜怀故山 · 黄滔","name":"客舍秋晚夜怀故山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥寥深巷客中居，况值穷秋百事疎。\n孤枕忆山千里外，破窗闻雨五更初。\n经年荒草侵幽迳，几树西风锁弊庐。\n长系寸心归未得，起挑残烛独踌躇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}